</p><p><font       color="#FFFFFF">Better than lying here suffering.    compellable      climatology    A</font></p><p><font   color="#FFFFFA">"And I only have one of those,»he said, and began to laugh wildly in the empty room in front of the hateful Royal with its gap-toothed grin. — a week after she brought those oogy sundaes?  sound.      He was halfway there when Annie opened her eyes. I've been her prisoner here for at least two weeks, maybe as long as a month.     "That night I changed your medication for something a little stronger, and when I was sure you weren't going to wake up even if someone exploded a grenade under your bed, I got my little tool-kit from the cellar shelf and I took the keyplate off that door.    But instead of weeping with exalted grief as she should have done when Misery expired giving birth to the boy whom Ian and Geoffrey would presumably raise together, she was mad as hell.       clam</font></p>
