</p><p><font     color="#FFFFF2">"Get the hell off my land!    copenhagen  convert    ""How many times, God damn it?</font></p><p><font      color="#FFFFF5">Some three years ago he had eaten his favorite polo pony after it had broken two legs and needed to be destroyed.  "I don't give a fuck,»he said, and this was almost the truth. Annie smiled.  Boom.    "He said nothing.     Although Paul had no way of knowing exactly what it was, he was sure that Annie had an adjective for it. He would walk with a limp for the rest of his life the doctors told him, but he would walk, and eventually he would walk without pain.      compress</font></p>
