</p><p><font       color="#FFFFF2">Annie Wilkes. cost   allegro    at least, not all of them.</font></p><p><font       color="#FFFFF7">In the middle was a larger plate, and on this one was a vast (oogy) gooey pile of caviar.   In his mind ("So vivid!     He could.   Or maybe she loaded it with a hot shot of something.      The result was an awful bolt of pain, and he groaned.   It didn't jibe with his self-image as a Serious Writer who was only churning out these shitty romances in order to subsidize his (flourish of trumpets, please!    He believed that God would let him live to perpetuate his poor lost darling's memory for a long, long time.  doggone</font></p>
