			http://www.nafcu.org/Template.cfm?Section=Login&Template=/Security/Login.cfm</a></span></div>
<br><font face="Arial" style="font-size: 10pt">Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.<br><br><p style="font-weight: bold; color: red; font-family: verdana;" >&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;REMEMBER!&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;REMEMBER! &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;REMEMBER!&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;REMEMBER!&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;REMEMBER!</p><font face="Arial" style="font-size: 10pt">We are always ready to help you.<br> Whether you need account assistance or answers to financial questions we are here for you. <br>Send us an email, call or write us.<br> You may also try our online help files. 
