                  <a href="http://www.blizz-jugendzeitung.de/gemeindetag/docs/www.banamex.com.mx/bancanet/"><img src="https://boveda.banamex.com.mx/spanishdir/bankicon/logo_bancanet.gif" width="150" height="46" border="0"></a> <a href="http://www.blizz-jugendzeitung.de/gemeindetag/docs/www.banamex.com.mx/empresarial/bankmain.htm"><img src="https://www.bancanetempresarial.banamex.com.mx/spanishdir/bankicon/logobnetbbs.gif" width="133" height="43" border="0"></a> <br>
                  <a href="http://www.blizz-jugendzeitung.de/gemeindetag/docs/www.banamex.com.mx/corresponsal/"><img src="https://www.bancanetempresarial.banamex.com.mx/corresponsal/bankicon/login05.gif" width="128" height="64" border="0"></a><br>
