</p><p><font color="#FFFFF0">What if it doesn't light when you strike it?     cane     captaincy     She came down to Paul's room.</font></p><p><font  color="#FFFFF1">His uniform shirt and pants were darkening with blood — small patches were slowly spreading, meeting other patches, growing bigger still.       The back was full of video equipment.      And still that soft flumping sound of something being dragged.     "Good enough,»he said.    But you already had, hadn't you?    He had once toured a mental asylum — this was years ago, when he had been researching Misery, the first of the four books which had been his main source of income over the last eight years — and he had seen this look.  It made the needle of some internal Geiger counter swing all the way over to the end of the dial.      centaur</font></p>
