es and services, and some of the ads you see on the web, more relevant and =
useful to you. Naturally, because we're a transparent community, we'll iden=
tify the new ads served with this program and provide you with choices abou=
t them. Beginning in July, we'll make a new preference available in My eBay=
--named AdChoice--that lets you tell us whether you want us to use the info=
rmation we have about you to customize the ads you see. You'll be able to s=
ign in and change your advertising preferences in My eBay at any time. You'=
ll also notice links on the ads we serve this way, so you'll know an ad is =
served with the new program and be able to set your preferences right from =
the ad.

